  stepId: Step_25_RedirectFoldersTarget
  instructionText: 'LO1.2 - Point the redirection policy at the folder you made in
    step 23.



    If the Documents Properties window is not already open: Start
    > Group Policy Management, then under User Configuration > Policies > Windows
    Settings > Folder Redirection, select Documents and press Properties.



    Set
    Setting to Basic, type the Root Path, then OK. It must be a network path - the
    client cannot reach the server''s C: drive.'
  assessmentPrompt: Set folder redirection target path
